        <h1 class="profile-detail-name">Florence</h1>
        <div class="info-stats" style="margin-top:10px;">
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Period</span><span class="info-stat-val">59 BCE – present</span></div>
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Founded</span><span class="info-stat-val">Established by the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/roman-empire">Romans</a> in 59 BCE as a colony for veteran soldiers, in an area previously inhabited by an Etruscan settlement whose name is unknown.</span></div>
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Where</span><span class="info-stat-val">In a basin ringed by hills on the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/arno">Arno</a> river in Tuscany, in central <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/italy">Italy</a>, about 275 kilometres north-west of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/rome">Rome</a>.</span></div>
